{
  "title": "Dove {ip:vai}? Perché non {ip:resti}?",
  "translation": "Where are you going? Why don't you stay?",
  "topics": "Questions, negation with non, the linking words e, ma, o, perché, quindi",
  "grammar": {
    "explain": [
      "A yes/no question has the same word order as a statement. Only the voice rises, and in writing you add a question mark: *{ip:Parli} italiano?*",
      {
        "table": {
          "head": [
            "Question word",
            "Meaning",
            "Example"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "chi",
              "who",
              "Chi {ip:è}?"
            ],
            [
              "che cosa",
              "what",
              "Che cosa {ip:fai}?"
            ],
            [
              "dove",
              "where",
              "Dove {ip:abiti}?"
            ],
            [
              "quando",
              "when",
              "Quando {ip:parti}?"
            ],
            [
              "come",
              "how",
              "Come ti {ip:chiami}?"
            ],
            [
              "perché",
              "why",
              "Perché {ip:studi} italiano?"
            ],
            [
              "quanto",
              "how much",
              "Quanto {ip:costa}?"
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "*Quanto* agrees with the noun that follows: *quanti anni, quante persone*. And *perché* means both *why* and *because*.",
      "To make a sentence negative, put *non* directly before the verb: *Non {ip:parlo} inglese. Marco non {ip:lavora}.*",
      {
        "table": {
          "head": [
            "Linking word",
            "Meaning",
            "Example"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "e",
              "and",
              "Luca e Anna"
            ],
            [
              "ma",
              "but",
              "{ip:Sono} stanco, ma {ip:lavoro}."
            ],
            [
              "o",
              "or",
              "Caffè o tè?"
            ],
            [
              "perché",
              "because",
              "{ip:Resto} a casa perché {ip:piove}."
            ],
            [
              "quindi",
              "so, therefore",
              "{ip:Piove}, quindi {ip:resto} a casa."
            ]
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "use": {
    "exercises": [
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "prompt": "Choose the right question word.",
        "questions": [
          {
            "q": "___ {ip:abiti}? — A Roma.",
            "options": [
              "Chi",
              "*Dove",
              "Quando"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "___ {ip:è}? — {ip:È} Marco.",
            "options": [
              "*Chi",
              "Come",
              "Dove"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "___ {ip:parti}? — Domani.",
            "options": [
              "Perché",
              "Dove",
              "*Quando"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "___ {ip:costa}? — Due euro.",
            "options": [
              "Come",
              "*Quanto",
              "Chi"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "___ ti {ip:chiami}? — Anna.",
            "options": [
              "*Come",
              "Che cosa",
              "Dove"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "___ {ip:fai}? — {ip:Leggo}.",
            "options": [
              "Chi",
              "*Che cosa",
              "Quanto"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "gap",
        "prompt": "Complete with e, ma, o, perché or quindi.",
        "questions": [
          "{ip:Vuoi} un caffè [[o]] un tè?",
          "{ip:Sono} stanco, [[ma]] {ip:vado} al lavoro.",
          "{ip:Resto} a casa [[perché]] {ip:sono} malato.",
          "{ip:Piove}, [[quindi]] {ip:prendo} l'autobus.",
          "Anna [[e]] Paolo {ip:sono} amici."
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "write",
        "prompt": "Make each sentence negative.",
        "questions": [
          {
            "q": "{ip:Parlo} inglese.",
            "a": [
              "Non parlo inglese."
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "Marco {ip:lavora} oggi.",
            "a": [
              "Marco non lavora oggi."
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "{ip:Abitiamo} a Roma.",
            "a": [
              "Non abitiamo a Roma."
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
